# `C97`'s third column, leg two. Differs from `services-allow.config` in exactly one line — the
# default `api` base is `/other` rather than `/base` — so that the pair says the absolute target
# reaches the same address while the base underneath it moves.

env local default
  api "http://127.0.0.1:4507/other"
  api second "http://127.0.0.1:4507/second"
  allow hosts "127.0.0.1"
